uto-left      \"     uk-scrollspy-class>\n<div class=\"uk-panel uk-width-expand  \">\n<div class=\"          \" >\n<p>Werden Sie Teil eines gesund gewachsenen und erfolgreichen Unternehmens in den Bereichen Mobilfunk, Glasfaser und Netzwerkinfrastruktur – als Teil der audius Gruppe mit starken Perspektiven und echten Entwicklungsmöglichkeiten.</p></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ukc_75 ce_rsce_uk_panel_start        uk-text-right  \"   style=\"  \"  >\n<div  class=\"uk-panel             \"\nstyle=\"    \" >\n</div>\n</div></div>\n</div></div></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</section>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n<div id=\"container\">\n<main id=\"main\">\n<div class=\"inside\">\n<section id=\"sectionwrapper80\" class=\"uk-position-relative mod_article start-section-container block\"  uk-scrollspy=\"target: [uk-scrollspy-class]; cls: uk-animation-slide-bottom-medium; delay: ;\">\n<div class=\" section80 uk-section  uk-background-norepeat  uk-background-bottom-left    \" style=\"   background-image: url(files/sinnwell/0allgemein/svg/punktebackground.svg); \"   id=\"article-80\"   >\n<div class=\"uk-container uk-container-large  uk-container-expand-right\">\n<div class=\"    uk-grid-column-large   \" uk-grid>\n<div class=\"ce_rsce_uk_grid2_start ukg_1531           \" style=\"    \"     >\n<div class=\"inside uk-grid uk-position-relative             uk-grid-column-large  \" uk-grid=\" \">\n<div class=\"ce_rsce_uk_column_start   uk-width-1-1 uk-width-1-2@l  uk-width-2-3@m             uk-margin-xlarge-bottom  \" style=\"  \"    ><div class=\" uk-width-1-1 ce_rsce_uk_divider line-decor \"  uk-scrollspy-class>\n<hr class=\"ukd_1533 \"\nstyle=\"border-top-color: black;\"\n\" >\n</div>\n<div class=\" ce_rsce_uk_text hyphens       \"     uk-scrollspy-class>\n<div class=\"  uk-heading-medium        \" >\n<p><span class=\"uk-h3 text-mini-einschub green-color\">Karriere</span><span> <span>Entscheide <span class=\"green-color\">dich</span> für <span class=\"green-color\"> uns</span></s